  "question": {
    "text": "Two capacitors $C_1$ and $C_2$ are connected in parallel to a battery. Charge-time graph is shown below for the two capacitors. The energy stored with them are $U_1$ and $U_2$, respectively. Which of the given statements is true?\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/D32wjMmBXT43HqZNd6PJ9mZ_Vn9-qWtVO-NRgBTtrVo.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "iLdRK",
      "text": "$\\mathrm{C}_2\\gt\\mathrm{C}_1, \\mathrm{U}_2 \\lt \\mathrm{U}_1$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EFvAU",
      "text": "$\\mathrm{C}_1\\gt\\mathrm{C}_2, \\mathrm{U}_1\\gt\\mathrm{U}_2$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ByvxQ",
      "text": "$\\mathrm{C}_1\\gt\\mathrm{C}_2, \\mathrm{U}_1 \\lt \\mathrm{U}_2$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cHpHc",
      "text": "$\\mathrm{C}_2\\gt\\mathrm{C}_1, \\mathrm{U}_2\\gt\\mathrm{U}_1$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "For a capacitor at steady state\n$q=C V \\text { and } U=\\frac{1}{2} C V^2$\n\nSince $C_1$ and $C_2$ are connected in parallel, $V_1=V_2$.\nAlso from graph $q_1 < q_2$\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\Rightarrow \\quad C_1 V_1 < C_2 V_2 \\\\\n& \\text { i.e. } C_1 < C_2 \\text { or } C_2>C_1 \\\\\n& \\qquad \\frac{U_1}{U_2}=\\frac{C_1 V_1^2}{C_2 V_2^2}=\\frac{C_1}{C_2} < 1\n\\end{aligned}$\nor $U_1 < U_2$ or $U_2>U_1$",
    "image": null
  },
